      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_sister_02",
      "hash64": "05DBA69DE4B5214D",
      "text": "Hé hé hé... Tu veux dire que Septentria\\nn’a rien à envier à vos grandes villes, là ?\\r\\nÇa, tout le monde le savait déjà, hein ![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_sister_03",
      "hash64": "05DBA59DE4B51F9A",
      "text": "Ben alors ? T’es si ébahi[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e par la splendeur de\\nnos traditions que les mots te manquent ?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
